r","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the Barry County record runs 75 years, from 1951 to 2025, and on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 9 grids October to November came in under 90% of normal in 35 of them. In 2025, January to February came in at 65% of normal on the middle of the grids. So far in 2026, the middle shows March to April at 213% and June to July at 81%. Grid 26880 had its driest year in 1963, at 63% of normal.</p>"}
